# novi(1) translation units.  The main TU is novi.c (the editor loop and the
# screen); these two are its halves: buffer.c is the disk-backed gap buffer,
# terminal.c the raw-mode/key/cursor layer.  No optional libraries -- novi
# writes its own ANSI sequences rather than going through termcap/curses.
src/userland/novi/buffer.c
src/userland/novi/terminal.c
